Z||000002||StuGood||10-26-2001||05:25 PM||||Stock Fieros don't <B>have</B> a cam sensor.<P>I would suggest you check your ignition timing.  It wants to be set at 10 degrees BTDC, with the diagnostic terminal grounded.<P>||||reg||1
